110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r59DDhaBxWUQ7kNvwFsbrRP&_nc_oc=AdqkpxeLpnF86aySpbhqeZL_gX-Hpc_YtW9WgKQlAlDp6z3XQt0b_4AVJn8MCZXDQbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1tpyTSCJ3XVFvln2kGVkVtq0soN9N7IfTrMUuWG3Kjaw&oe=69D7BA35"}, "display_name": "UltrasClash V", "keywords": [], "long_description": "** THIS PRODUCT IS IN EARLY ACCESS, IT MAY CONTAIN SOME GLITCHES, because we believe that the best way to develop the game is with the help of the community**\n\nUltrasClash V is a physics based, fast paced anime combat!!! Fight hordes of hostile and powerful enemies like cactus head policemen, stupid minionsand giant dinosaur in a desperate, yet unmistakably hilarious, fight for survival.\n\nIn Ultrasclash V the combat is limited only by your own creativity. Choose your fighting style, choose your weapons, chose you powers. Be the powerful fighter you always dreamed of becoming!\n\nFEATURES\n\n\ud83d\udc4aPunch Movement System: we created a VR locomotion system which allows you to move punching in the direction you choose to move to!\n\n\u26a1\ufe0fSpecial Attacks: Charge up your aura to full power and unleash devastating finishing moves!\n\n\u2604\ufe0fPhysical engine: we bring you accurate physics feedbacks in addition to badass sounds and enemies!\n\n\ud83e\uddbeMOD KIT Support coming soon...", "short_description": "UltrasClash V is a sandbox anime action game, designed and primed to bring you a unique and creative approach to being a hero and unleash all your super powers!"}]}, "developer_name": "IOX S.r.l.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ultrasclash.com/3009-2/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.ultrasclash.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "IOX S.r.l.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ultrasclash.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id"